# Provenance of the Sail golden-model PMP reference.
#
# The source and hash pins below are re-checked by `make sail-provenance`
# (fv/sail/provenance.sh), which needs no Sail toolchain. The compiler pin is
# checked by Containerfile.sail, which CI builds to run regen.sh --verify.

[reference model]
name                sail-riscv (the RISC-V ISA formal model, Sail language)
release             0.12
commit              65ddde80ee2b131bf46c20e6e748343c336c4071
location            ./sail-riscv  (git submodule, pinned)
upstream sources    model/pmp/pmp_control.sail   -> slice/pmp_control.sail (specialized)
                                                -> slice/pmp_hw.sail (loop body, unrolled 16x)
                    model/pmp/pmp_regs.sail      -> slice/pmp_slice_prelude.sail (helpers + types)
                    model/core, model/extensions -> slice/pmp_slice_prelude.sail (types)
                    model/prelude/prelude.sail   -> slice/pmp_base.sail (mostly verbatim)
                    model/prelude/errors.sail    -> slice/errors.sail (verbatim)
licence             BSD-2-Clause (see NOTICE)

